    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered" style="max-width: 450px;">
        <div class="modal-content shadow-lg" style="border: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;">
            <div class="modal-body pb-0">
                <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px;">Are you sure you want to make the deal?</p>
                <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.5;">👉 Click 'OK' for Yes<br>👉 Click 'Cancel' for No</div>
